<title>DENMARK: A.P.Moeller up on Bergesen.</title>
<headline>A.P.Moeller up on Bergesen.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping group A.P. Moeller's shares soared on Thursday, lifted by a knock-on effect after better-than-expected first quarter results from Norwegian shipping heavyweight Bergesen, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0930 GMT its D/S Svendborg B share was up 3.4 percent, by 11,000 crowns, to 331,000. D/S 1912 B showed a more modest gain of 3,230 crowns to 230,230.</p>
<p>The less traded A shares, and were up respectively 9,000 crowns to 325,000 and 11,000 crowns to 230,000.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 3396950</p>
</text>
